title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.unemployed) {
    Q.unemployed_2 = Q.unemployed.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.inflation) {
    Q.inflation_2 = Q.inflation.toFixed(1);
}
Q.economic_growth_2 = '0';
if (Q.economic_growth) {
    Q.economic_growth_2 = Q.economic_growth.toFixed(1);
}
!}

= Status

[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Resources available: [+ resources +]

Razem's position: [? if Raz_toleration : toleration ?][? if Raz_in_government : in government - ?][? if Raz_toleration == 0 and spd_in_government == 0 and Raz_caretaker == 0 : opposition ?][? if Raz_caretaker : caretaker government ?]
[? if in_weimar_coalition and Raz_in_government: Weimar Coalition ?][? if in_grand_coalition and Raz_in_government: Grand Coalition ?][? if in_popular_front and Raz_in_government: Popular Front ?][? if in_left_front and Raz_in_government: Left Front ?][? if in_spd_majority and Raz_in_government: SPD majority ?][? if in_minority_government and Raz_in_government: minority government ?][? if in_emergency_government and Raz_in_government: emergency government ?]

[? if spd_in_government and not in_spd_majority and not in_left_front : Coalition dissent: [+ coalition_dissent : coalition_dissent +] ?]

[? if spd_in_government and (in_left_front or in_popular_front): KPD coalition dissent: [+ kpd_coalition_dissent : coalition_dissent +] ?]

Internal dissent: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

